" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Fire / life-safety</text><text x=\"810\" y=\"525\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">Daily operations failures</text><rect x=\"50\" y=\"600\" width=\"500\" height=\"380\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.15)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"300\" y=\"660\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"26\">FINANCIAL</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"715\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Claim denials</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"755\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Fraud / FCA exposure</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"795\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Professional liability</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"835\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Reimbursement risk</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"875\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Capital and credit risk</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"935\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">Dollars at risk</text><rect x=\"570\" y=\"600\" width=\"480\" height=\"380\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(139,92,246,0.15)\" stroke=\"#8b5cf6\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"810\" y=\"660\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#8b5cf6\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"26\">STRATEGIC</text><text x=\"810\" y=\"715\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Data breach / cyber</text><text x=\"810\" y=\"755\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Reputational damage</text><text x=\"810\" y=\"795\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Accreditation loss</text><text x=\"810\" y=\"835\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Regulatory sanctions</text><text x=\"810\" y=\"875\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">M&amp;A and market shifts</text><text x=\"810\" y=\"935\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">Future viability at risk</text></svg>",
                    "caption": "Risk extends well beyond the bedside"
